4942,"strength":0,"label":"C","measured":true}],"votes":"3 of 3 agreed with the outline"},"handSpan":null,"draft":{"curtainType":"unknown","chosenStockCm":180,"diameterMm":35,"reply":"Thanks for the video. Your frame measured 121 cm across the outside of the window frame or its surround, very close to your 119 cm. For that I would take the 180 cm pole and cut it to 156 cm, which is 12 cm off each end. That leaves 17.5 cm past the frame each side with 2 brackets, which sits inside my usual 15 cm to 20 cm band.\n\nThe 150 cm pole would work as supplied with 14.5 cm past the frame each side, but it is a little tight for curtains to clear the glass. Please allow for the finials as they add 9 cm at each end. Best wishes, Rob","questions":[],"ranOn":"muse-spark-1.3"},"fps":3,"blinds":{"options":[{"fit":"outside, standard","widthMm":1305,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":50,"note":"covers the opening with a little to spare each side"},{"fit":"outside, blackout","widthMm":1365,"dropMm":null,"overlapEachSideMm":80,"note":"wider overlap so less light gets round the sides"}],"draft":{"reply":"Hello and thanks for sending the clip over, I really appreciate it.\n\nI measured the outside of the window frame or its surround as 121 cm.\n\nFor an outside fit to order:\nStandard is 130.5 cm wide, with 5 cm overlap each side, covers the opening with a little to spare each side.\nBlackout is 136.5 cm wide, with 8 cm overlap each side, wider overlap so less light gets round the sides.\n\nI could not measure the drop from the clip. Could you measure the height for me and let me know which edges you measured between?\n\nBest wishes","questions":["Could you measure the height for me and let me know which edges you measured between?"]},"model":"muse-spark-1.3"}}